
# Simple Interest Calculator

## Description
A simple interest calculator that calculates interest based on principal amount, rate of interest, and time period.

## Formula
Simple Interest = (P * R * T) / 100

## Features
- Calculates Simple Interest
- Easy to use
- Displays Total Amount

## Example
Principal = 1000
Rate = 5%
Time = 2 years

Simple Interest = 100
Total Amount = 1100

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
